    <system:String
        x:Key="NavigatorSettings.Incoming.Intersections.Description">Determines what the opening task intersects in the current file: constructions, already placed real openings, both or nothing. Statuses: "no intersection", "completed", "not match", "new". If the check is disabled, every task gets the "new" status.</system:String>
